Tiamat looks like a nightmare creation, sporting the necks and heads of 
white, black, green, blue, and red great wyrms.  The mass of heads seems 
to move like a group of writhing snakes, joining above massive muscular 
shoulders.  Her black scales are small for a dragon of this size, and gleam 
like ebony pearls.  The great dragons belly is blue tinged with black, and 
her tail seems to shift in hue as it twitches from emerald green to midnight 
black to sapphire blue.  Tiamat's legs are thick as great trees, and her 
wings-black on the exterior and red as blood on the underside-are huge.
~
